{"id":"470125","name":"番茄浓汤","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"","cover":"images/470125/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"番茄","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"少许"},{"name":"金蒜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"蒜头","amount":"1粒"},{"name":"橄榄油","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"番茄一个。","img":"images/470125/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洗净切片，蒜头一粒。","img":"images/470125/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"把番茄和蒜头装到搅拌机杯里。","img":"images/470125/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量的水。","img":"images/470125/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"盖好盖子上搅拌机打一分钟。","img":"images/470125/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把番茄汁倒到锅里中火煮开。","img":"images/470125/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"用汤勺轻轻搅动，番茄汤变红了，调少许盐，橄榄油，少许水淀粉，再搅拌一下。","img":"images/470125/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"可以盛上碗了，放少许金蒜，葱花。","img":"images/470125/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品，酸甜可口。","img":"images/470125/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}